The cases in this directory are derived from RAGTruth, which is distributed
under the MIT License by Particle Media.

    https://github.com/ParticleMedia/RAGTruth

Each case records the upstream response id, source id and generating model in
its `source` field, so any case can be traced back to the original record.
Sentences and passages are reproduced from that dataset; the pairing, the
filtering and the labels in the `expect` field are ours.

The RAGTruth authors ask that work using the dataset cite their paper:

    @article{niu2024ragtruth,
      title   = {RAGTruth: A Hallucination Corpus for Developing Trustworthy
                 Retrieval-Augmented Language Models},
      author  = {Niu, Cheng and Wu, Yuanhao and Zhu, Juno and Xu, Siliang and
                 Shum, Kashun and Zhong, Randy and Song, Juntong and
                 Zhang, Tong},
      journal = {arXiv preprint arXiv:2401.00396},
      year    = {2024}
    }
